-- l4 batch over two defaulted inputs, one of them with a name holding a
-- semicolon: names may contain the characters a separator would need, which
-- is why the CSV `presumed` column is a JSON list.

§ `Capacity`
    GIVEN `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE

@export Can contract
GIVEN `is adult` IS A BOOLEAN
      `of sound mind; sober` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`can contract` MEANS `is adult` AND `has capacity` AND `of sound mind; sober`
